</div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="_LoansNotesTradeAndOtherReceivablesDisclosureTextBlock-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="us-gaap:LoansNotesTradeAndOtherReceivablesDisclosureTextBlock" id="ixv-15459"><p style="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Note
4: Loans and Allowance for Credit Losses</span></p>

<p style="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

