6: Goodwill and Intangibles</span></p>

<p style="font: italic 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.2in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: normal">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: normal">On
January 17, 2025, the Company acquired The Marblehead Bank of Marblehead, Ohio. The acquisition resulted in approximately $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:GoodwillAcquiredDuringPeriod" scale="6" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-35080">3.9</ix:nonFraction> million
in goodwill. <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="_ScheduleOfGoodwillTextBlock-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfGoodwillTextBlock" id="ixv-35081">The balance of goodwill was $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c3" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:Goodwill" scale="6" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-35082">27.2</ix:nonFraction> million at December 31, 2025, and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c4" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:Goodwill" scale="6" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-35083">23.2</ix:nonFraction> million at December 31, 2024.</ix:nonNumeric></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in"><span style="font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>

