expense for intangibles for the years ended December 31, 2025, and 2024 was $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets" scale="6" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-35099">0.24</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c5" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets" scale="6" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-35100">0.07</ix:nonFraction> million, respectively. Estimated
amortization expense for each of the following <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c3" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="sbfg:EstimatedAmortization" id="ixv-35101">five years</ix:nonNumeric> is reflected in the table below.</span></p>

