7: Mortgage Banking and Servicing Rights</span></p>

<p style="font: italic 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: italic 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Mortgage
loans serviced for others are not included in the accompanying consolidated balance sheets. The unpaid principal balance of mortgage
loans serviced for others approximated $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c306" decimals="-8" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="sbfg:UnpaidPrincipalBalanceOfMortgageLoansServicedForOthers" scale="9" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-35108">1.5</ix:nonFraction> billion at December 31, 2025, and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c307" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="sbfg:UnpaidPrincipalBalanceOfMortgageLoansServicedForOthers" scale="6" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-35109">1.4</ix:nonFraction> million at December 31, 2024. Contractually specified
servicing fees of approximately $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="sbfg:ContractuallySpecifiedServicingFees" scale="6" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-35110">3.6</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c5" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="sbfg:ContractuallySpecifiedServicingFees" scale="6" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-35111">3.5</ix:nonFraction> million were included in mortgage loan servicing fees in the consolidated income
statement for the years ended December 31, 2025, and 2024, respectively.</span></p>

<p style="font: italic 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

