</div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="_MinorityInterestDisclosureTextBlock-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="us-gaap:MinorityInterestDisclosureTextBlock" id="ixv-25062"><p style="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Note
9: Interest-Bearing Deposits</span></p>

<p style="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: normal">Interest-bearing
time deposits in denominations of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c322" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestBearingDepositLiabilities" scale="3" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-35183">250,000</ix:nonFraction> or more totaled $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseTimeDeposits" scale="6" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-35184">56.1</ix:nonFraction> million on December 31, 2025, and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c5" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseTimeDeposits" scale="6" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-35185">53.7</ix:nonFraction> million on December 31, 2024.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0in">&#160;</p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" escape="true" name="us-gaap:TimeDepositMaturitiesTableTextBlock" id="ixv-25070"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: normal">At
December 31, 2025, the scheduled maturities of time deposits were as follows:</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0in"><span style="font: normal 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>

