Committee</b></span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
procedures by which shareholders of the Company may recommend nominees to the Company&#8217;s Board of Directors are described under
the caption &#8220;CORPORATE GOVERNANCE &#8211; Nominations of Directors&#8221; in the Company&#8217;s 2026 Proxy Statement. The procedures
by which shareholders of the Company may recommend nominees to the Company&#8217;s Board of Directors have not materially changed from
those described in the Company&#8217;s definitive Proxy Statement for the 2025 Annual Meeting of Shareholders held on April 17, 2025.</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p><div>

